# Always check out with LF.
#
# Windows runners default to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites every text
# file to CRLF on checkout. gofmt normalises to LF, so `gofmt -l` then reports
# every Go file as mis-formatted on Windows even though nothing is wrong —
# the check passed on Ubuntu and failed on Windows for the same commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
